# scripts/check_observability_thresholds.py's last-observed-counters state --
# only ever meant to live inside the observability-alerts.yml workflow's own
# actions/cache, never committed. Present locally only if someone runs the
# script by hand.
current_state.json

# documents/*.pdf deliberately tracked, not ignored (2026-09-08): the 5
# source PDFs (BNS/BNSS/BSA/CrPC/IPC, ~6.85MB total) used to be excluded
# here, but the exclusion was unexplained boilerplate from this repo's
# first commit (git log -p --follow), not a documented licensing or size
# decision -- checked directly: no LICENSE file anywhere in the repo, no
# redistribution/copyright note in documents/provenance.json or any docs
# file. provenance.json's source_url + source_sha256 per act is a re-
# download path, not a backup -- it's a bet that five government URLs
# resolve to byte-identical files years from now. 6.85MB is nothing;
# tracking the real files directly is safer than depending on that bet.
